---
title: "compute_proposer_indices (Fulu -- The Beacon Chain)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_start_slot: start_slot = compute_start_slot_at_epoch(epoch)
    q_start_slot --> q_seeds: seeds = [hash(seed + uint_to_bytes(Slot(start_slot + i))) for i in range(SLOTS_PER_EPOCH)]
    q_seeds --> q_compute: proposers = [compute_proposer_index(state, indices, s) for s in seeds]
    q_compute --> [*]: return proposers
    note right of q_compute
        INV-001: Exactly SLOTS_PER_EPOCH proposer indices are produced
        INV-002: Each seed is uniquely derived from the base seed and slot offset
        INV-003: All returned indices must be from the active validator set
    end note
